-- נספח ב' — תאום משכורות לעובדי הוראה, החל מ־1.9.2018: the combined-salary
-- table of the upper-division teaching employees in the Oz LaTmura reform from 1.9.2018, by year
-- of seniority (1 to 36) and salary grade (a doctor, MA, BA, a senior
-- teacher or certified professional instructor, a certified teacher, a
-- professional instructor certified in practice, an intermediate
-- professional instructor), as the conditions-of-service portal publishes
-- it — the Ministry's paymaster's letterhead ("לשכת חשב — תאום משכורות
-- לעובדי הוראה"). The corpus files it as "nispach-bet_2008"; it is not a
-- table of the reform of 2008.
--
-- It is annex ב' of the wage agreement of 14.3.2018 for the upper division
-- as the agreement of 28.4.2019 replaced annexes A–D, which owners'
-- circular תשע"ט/7 attaches and which is encoded with that circular
-- (imported): from 1.9.2018 the tables are updated for seniority 1 to 7,
-- and from 1.12.2018 by a further 1.2%. Checked here: the table is that
-- circular's annex ב' (annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018), row for row and cell for cell, and prints the
-- day the circular's list gives it. The circular's own checks of the
-- annexes against §4.1 of the agreement (its findings F-2018-19_tashat_07-a
-- and -b) hold of this table with it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `2018-19_tashat_07`

§ `נספח ב' — תאום משכורות לעובדי הוראה, החל מ־1.9.2018`

-- The annex's label and the day it prints: "נספח ב'-החל מ-1.9.2018".
@ref akn:hc_1/p1
`the portal's annex ב' of the upper division applies from` MEANS Date 1 9 2018

-- akn:hc_1/p2 The letterhead: "מדינת ישראל"; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p3 The letterhead: "משרד החינוך"; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p4 The letterhead: "לשכת חשב", the Ministry's paymaster; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p5 The letterhead: "תאום משכורות לעובדי הוראה", the teaching staff's salary coordination; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p6 The letterhead: "אגף בכיר כוח-אדם בהוראה"; no rule.

